# MitamaOS repository ignore rules
#
# Policy (decision "Option A"): the repo tracks code and SMALL assets. Large,
# rarely-changing binaries are distributed via GitHub Releases, not committed,
# so clones stay small and fast.

# --- Big distributables: ship via Releases, never commit ---
# The on-device assistant model (~4.7 MB, streamed from SD at runtime).
model.bin
**/model.bin
# Emulator binaries (the ".extension" blobs) and game ROMs.
*.extension
*.nes
*.gb
*.gbc
*.gba
*.sfc
*.smc
*.n64
*.z64
*.rom

# --- Build output ---
.pio/
**/.pio/
build/
*.elf
*.map
# Note: we deliberately do NOT blanket-ignore *.bin here beyond model.bin,
# because the only .bin we'd ever track is distributed via Releases anyway.

# --- Python (merge.py / tooling scratch) ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Editor / OS cruft ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Kept on purpose (documented for future contributors) ---
# Small assets ARE committed: Rajdhani VLW fonts (*.vlw), theme files (*.thm),
# icon/boot PNGs, Lua scripts, and the compendium seed data. They are small,
# human-reviewable, and part of the source.
